# Walkthrough: Evario Odyssey (Sky World & Transparency Update)

Welcome to the **Sky World**! The game environment has been completely transformed into a vibrant atmospheric level with perfect asset transparency.

## Atmospheric Enhancements
- **Vibrant Sky Gradient**: A dynamic sunset gradient (Blue to Red to Yellow) provides a premium backgdrop.
- **Cloud Platforms**: Replaced the dark blocks with fluffy, interactive cloud sprites.
- **Floating Background Clouds**: Added decorative clouds with parallax movement for depth.
- **Perfect Transparency**: Implemented a custom Chroma Key filter in [main.js](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/EvaGames/evario/src/main.js) to ensure characters and clouds blend seamlessly into the sky.

